# DingTalk custom robot webhook config for mwan3-notify-worker.sh - fill in
# real values and copy to /etc/mwan3-notify/dingtalk.conf ON THE ROUTER ONLY.
# Do not commit a filled-in copy of this file anywhere in the repo.
#
# chmod 600 /etc/mwan3-notify/dingtalk.conf after copying: it holds a
# webhook secret.
#
# In the DingTalk group: group settings -> robots -> add a custom robot,
# security setting "加签"（签名校验）. ACCESS_TOKEN is the access_token query
# parameter of the webhook URL DingTalk shows you; SECRET is the separate
# "SEC..." string shown for the 加签 setting. See
# https://open.dingtalk.com/document/robots/custom-robot-access

ACCESS_TOKEN=<access_token>
SECRET=<secret>
